From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] friends tray: tolerate shared activities without an active app

Neighborhood activity announcements can arrive while the shell is on Home or
Neighborhood and no Activity window is active.  Do not dereference the
missing active Activity while refreshing the Frame's Friends tray.

--- a/src/jarabe/frame/friendstray.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/frame/friendstray.py
@@ -91,6 +91,9 @@
     def __neighborhood_activity_added_cb(self, neighborhood_model,
                                          shared_activity):
         logging.debug('FriendsTray.__neighborhood_activity_added_cb')
         active_activity = shell.get_model().get_active_activity()
+        if active_activity is None or shared_activity is None:
+            logging.debug('FriendsTray: no active/shared activity yet')
+            return
         if active_activity.get_activity_id() != shared_activity.activity_id:
             return
